"use strict";(globalThis.webpackChunkfastplaz_docs||=[]).push([[8130],{7735(e){e.exports=JSON.parse('{"archive":{"blogPosts":[{"id":"/2026/11/07/release-hero-2026","metadata":{"permalink":"/blog/2026/11/07/release-hero-2026","source":"@site/blog/2026-11-07-release-hero-2026.md","title":"Release: Hero 2026","description":"FastPlaz Hero 2026","date":"2026-11-07T00:00:00.000Z","tags":[],"hasTruncateMarker":true,"authors":[{"name":"Luri Darmawan","url":"https://github.com/luridarmawan","imageURL":"https://github.com/luridarmawan.png","key":"luri","page":null}],"frontMatter":{"title":"Release: Hero 2026","authors":"luri"},"unlisted":false,"nextItem":{"title":"Release: Super Mom v0.12.22","permalink":"/blog/2020/12/22/release-supermom-v0.12.22"}},"content":"![FastPlaz Hero 2026](/img/blog/2026-hero.png)\\n\\nFastPlaz rilis 2026 dengan kode **\\"Hero\\"** hadir dengan dua fitur besar: aplikasi yang sama bisa berjalan sebagai **HTTP server standalone** maupun **CGI**, dan **AI Agent Plane**, coding agent langsung di dalam Lazarus IDE.\\n\\n\x3c!--truncate--\x3e\\n\\nRilis ini juga hasil review menyeluruh terhadap seluruh unit di `FastPlaz/src` dan `tools/src`: sekitar 170 commit, 365 file, +51.000 / \u221211.900 baris, dengan unit test untuk setiap library.\\n\\n## Headline\\n\\n1. **Satu binary, dua mode: Standalone HTTP dan CGI.** Aplikasi FastPlaz bisa jalan sebagai web server sendiri atau tetap sebagai CGI di Apache/nginx, tanpa ganti kode. [Selengkapnya](/docs/standalone)\\n2. **AI Agent Plane.** Claude Code, OpenCode, Pi, GitHub Copilot CLI, dan agent ACP lain langsung di dalam Lazarus IDE, lengkap dengan MCP server yang bisa membuka file, mengedit, _compile_, dan membuat controller/model FastPlaz. [Selengkapnya](/docs/ai-agent-plane)\\n3. **Review dan perbaikan menyeluruh.** Memory leak, double free, celah keamanan, dan bug lama diperbaiki.\\n4. **Lebih aman secara default.** CSRF per form, cookie session HttpOnly/SameSite/Secure, CSPRNG, perlindungan XXE, SQL yang di-_quote_, header injection ditutup.\\n5. **Lintas platform yang benar-benar dites.** Lebih dari 700 unit test FPCUnit, dijalankan di Windows dan Linux.\\n\\n## Fitur Baru\\n\\n### Standalone HTTP mode\\n\\n- Unit baru `fastplaz_app` menggantikan `fpcgi`. Mode dipilih otomatis: `--mode=cgi|http`, variabel `GATEWAY_INTERFACE`, atau `systems/server/mode` di `config.json`.\\n- Default `http://127.0.0.1:17845`.\\n- Graceful shutdown (Ctrl+C / SIGTERM), `max_requests`, koneksi database per request.\\n- Dukungan `X-Forwarded-*` di belakang reverse proxy tepercaya.\\n- Wizard project (Simple, API, Full Package) punya pilihan Run Mode HTTP/CGI.\\n\\n### AI Agent Plane\\n\\n- Jendela chat yang bisa di-_dock_ di menu **FastPlaz \u2192 Agent Plane**: jawaban markdown, code block dengan syntax highlighting, permission card, dan kartu pertanyaan.\\n- Ganti runtime, model, dan effort langsung dari chat.\\n- File yang diubah agent otomatis dimuat ulang di editor.\\n- MCP server bawaan (`127.0.0.1:17826`) dengan [19 tool](/docs/ai-agent-plane-mcp): editor, pencarian, _compile_ dan build, generator controller/model, serta referensi FastPlaz untuk agent.\\n\\n### Library\\n\\n- **SMTP client bawaan** (`smtp_lib`): `TMailer` bisa mengirim email tanpa Synapse.\\n- **Database**: `ExecScript` / `ExecSQLScript`, `QuoteIdentifier`, `QuoteValue`, `SoftDelete` yang benar-benar berfungsi.\\n- **Theme**: filter `escape`, `[if]` ditulis ulang (operator perbandingan, nesting), `[foreach]` bersarang.\\n- **Session**: `RegenerateID`, cookie HttpOnly/SameSite/Secure.\\n- **Redis**: IPv6, parsing RESP lengkap, connect timeout.\\n\\n### IDE Tools\\n\\n- Fast Code mendukung server yang kompatibel dengan OpenAI.\\n- Database Explorer: default MySQL 8.0, toolbar ikon, lebar kolom otomatis.\\n- Menu **FastPlaz \u2192 Open Console/Terminal** dan shortcut keyboard untuk menu FastPlaz.\\n- Terjemahan Bahasa Indonesia untuk IDE tools.\\n\\n## Sebelum Upgrade\\n\\nBeberapa perbaikan bisa mengubah perilaku aplikasi yang sudah ada, misalnya `Redirect`/`die` yang tidak lagi keluar dari method, session timeout dalam menit, dan `Save`/`Delete` yang mengembalikan `False`. Baca [Upgrade ke Rilis 2026](/docs/upgrade) terlebih dahulu.\\n\\nRepository: [github.com/fastplaz/fastplaz](https://github.com/fastplaz/fastplaz) \xb7 Brief lengkap: [RELEASE-2026-Hero.md](https://github.com/fastplaz/fastplaz/blob/development/docs/RELEASE-2026-Hero.md)"},{"id":"/2020/12/22/release-supermom-v0.12.22","metadata":{"permalink":"/blog/2020/12/22/release-supermom-v0.12.22","source":"@site/blog/2020-12-22-release-supermom-v0.12.22.md","title":"Release: Super Mom v0.12.22","description":"New Features","date":"2020-12-22T00:00:00.000Z","tags":[],"hasTruncateMarker":true,"authors":[{"name":"Luri Darmawan","url":"https://github.com/luridarmawan","imageURL":"https://github.com/luridarmawan.png","key":"luri","page":null}],"frontMatter":{"title":"Release: Super Mom v0.12.22","authors":"luri"},"unlisted":false,"prevItem":{"title":"Release: Hero 2026","permalink":"/blog/2026/11/07/release-hero-2026"},"nextItem":{"title":"Release: Hero v0.11.10","permalink":"/blog/2020/11/10/release-hero-v0.11.10"}},"content":"### New Features\\n\\n- Database Explorer\\n- Reveal File in Explorer/Finder\\n- JSON Visualization (TreeView)\\n- Regex Tester\\n- Full Package Example\\n\\n\x3c!--truncate--\x3e\\n\\nRepository tersedia di [https://github.com/fastplaz/fastplaz](https://github.com/fastplaz/fastplaz)"},{"id":"/2020/11/10/release-hero-v0.11.10","metadata":{"permalink":"/blog/2020/11/10/release-hero-v0.11.10","source":"@site/blog/2020-11-10-release-hero-v0.11.10.md","title":"Release: Hero v0.11.10","description":"FastPlaz Hero","date":"2020-11-10T00:00:00.000Z","tags":[],"hasTruncateMarker":true,"authors":[{"name":"Luri Darmawan","url":"https://github.com/luridarmawan","imageURL":"https://github.com/luridarmawan.png","key":"luri","page":null}],"frontMatter":{"title":"Release: Hero v0.11.10","authors":"luri"},"unlisted":false,"prevItem":{"title":"Release: Super Mom v0.12.22","permalink":"/blog/2020/12/22/release-supermom-v0.12.22"},"nextItem":{"title":"Release: Merdeka v0.0.0","permalink":"/blog/2015/08/17/release-merdeka-v0.0.0"}},"content":"![FastPlaz Hero](/img/blog/20201110-hero.jpg)\\n\\nSetelah 5 tahun lebih menanti akhirnya FastPlaz rilis ke master, dengan kode:\\n\\n# **Hero v0.11.0**\\n\\n\x3c!--truncate--\x3e\\n\\nRepository tersedia di [https://github.com/fastplaz/fastplaz](https://github.com/fastplaz/fastplaz)"},{"id":"/2015/08/17/release-merdeka-v0.0.0","metadata":{"permalink":"/blog/2015/08/17/release-merdeka-v0.0.0","source":"@site/blog/2015-08-17-release-merdeka-v0.0.0.md","title":"Release: Merdeka v0.0.0","description":"Features","date":"2015-08-17T00:00:00.000Z","tags":[],"hasTruncateMarker":true,"authors":[{"name":"Luri Darmawan","url":"https://github.com/luridarmawan","imageURL":"https://github.com/luridarmawan.png","key":"luri","page":null}],"frontMatter":{"title":"Release: Merdeka v0.0.0","authors":"luri"},"unlisted":false,"prevItem":{"title":"Release: Hero v0.11.10","permalink":"/blog/2020/11/10/release-hero-v0.11.10"},"nextItem":{"title":"Release: Ibu v0.0.0","permalink":"/blog/2014/12/22/release-ibu-v0.0.0"}},"content":"### Features\\n\\n- Redis support\\n- Themes generator\\n- Tagstrings\\n- Add html block tag\\n- Add permalink support @theme\\n- Prepare fastplaz integration package\\n\\n\\n\x3c!--truncate--\x3e\\n\\nRepository tersedia di [https://github.com/fastplaz/fastplaz](https://github.com/fastplaz/fastplaz)"},{"id":"/2014/12/22/release-ibu-v0.0.0","metadata":{"permalink":"/blog/2014/12/22/release-ibu-v0.0.0","source":"@site/blog/2014-12-22-release-ibu-v0.0.0.md","title":"Release: Ibu v0.0.0","description":"Release Ibu v0.0.0","date":"2014-12-22T00:00:00.000Z","tags":[],"hasTruncateMarker":false,"authors":[{"name":"Luri Darmawan","url":"https://github.com/luridarmawan","imageURL":"https://github.com/luridarmawan.png","key":"luri","page":null}],"frontMatter":{"title":"Release: Ibu v0.0.0","authors":"luri"},"unlisted":false,"prevItem":{"title":"Release: Merdeka v0.0.0","permalink":"/blog/2015/08/17/release-merdeka-v0.0.0"}},"content":"[Release Ibu v0.0.0](https://github.com/fastplaz/fastplaz/releases)"}]}}')}}]);